# AGENTS.md

Canonical repository guidance for any contributor or AI coding tool working in
`{{ .project_name }}`.

This file states **what this repository requires** (build/test/lint commands,
coverage gates, and Go conventions). It does **not** dictate which AI coding
harness or personal workflow you use. Pull request review rules live separately
in [`REVIEW.md`](REVIEW.md).

